  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated livestock management for nutrition in children under five years of age in Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this study is to determine the effectiveness of a livestock management intervention, with considerations for animal food security and water, reducing the risk of malnutrition among children and women in Kanem and BeG in Chad. We thus propose a multi-phase study conducted across three years</narrative>
  </description>
